Error [E3403]: `time.today` is non-deterministic and cannot appear in a pure evaluation.
  --> tests/ui/determinism/nondeterministic_time_classification_is_shared_by_purity_and_folding.jet:5:17
    |
  5 |     return date.today().to_string()
    |                 ^^^^^
 Why: Pure evaluation must produce the same result on every machine.
 Fix: Remove this call, or remove the enclosing function's explicit empty effect bound.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3403
